// Anatomy specimen library — the data behind /anatomie.
//
// Ported verbatim from Pascal's anatomy explorer (github.com/PascalBurume/anatomy,
// branch atelier-revision-4): 44 Meshopt-compressed GLB specimens, 201 hotspots,
// and their French teaching text. Only the model paths were rewritten — the
// models live under /models/anatomy/ here so they sit apart from the rest of
// public/ and can be excluded from the offline precache by prefix.
//
// Hotspot coordinates are in the normalised FIT_SIZE cube the loader fits each
// model into, so they mean the same thing for every specimen.

